Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?0177:=20diagnostic=20=E2=80=94=20drop=20the=20L?=
 =?UTF-8?q?uigi2D.szs=20shop=20icon?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

V1.3.34 crashes in the shop exactly like V1.3.33 (CRASH sig=11 addr=0
pc=main+0x1e4e68, same object 0x70c16c2208), so the index-shift fix did
not work. The log-64 vs log-67 [char] diff shows the only new
filesystem behaviour is Mario2D.szs -> Luigi2D.szs, and Luigi2D.szs
is not a 2D icon at all: it is Luigi's full 3D body (719KB, vs
Wario2D.szs 59KB), built from Luigi.szs's Mario.bfres with only the
FMDL renamed to Mario2D. This diagnostic build drops the file only:
dm_char_redirect only rewrites when the overlay actually has the
target (rom_overlay_path), otherwise it returns 0 and the original
content:/ObjectData/Mario2D.szs is kept, so the Luigi row's icon
falls back to Mario's 2D icon. If the shop stops crashing, Luigi2D
is the cause; if it still crashes, Luigi2D is innocent. Rows, MSBT
labels and everything else are unchanged.
---
 dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/Luigi2D.szs | Bin 719359 -> 0 bytes
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/Luigi2D.szs

diff --git a/dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/Luigi2D.szs b/dm/romfs-overlay/ObjectData/Luigi2D.szs
deleted file mode 100644
index 873ee09bbaf24762be267e206d6ce9e33f7f9d63..0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
GIT binary patch
literal 0
